    {
      "id": "1306",
      "Name": [
        "《艾斯弗德狂想曲》节目单碎片",
        "Program Fragment"
      ],
      "itemType": "3",
      "canAnalyzed": "false",
      "canCombined": "false",
      "Describe": [
        "James O'Sullivan 销毁后的节目单残片。\n残页还能读到“艾斯弗德狂想曲”和“爵士风暴”，\n风格标注为强劲节奏的爵士乐，\n配器是完整爵士乐队，并突出鼓组，\n音量等级为最高的 5 级。\n时间栏只剩下“晚间”的碎片，右下角有 V.R. 的签名。",
        "A burned program fragment recovered after James tried to destroy it.\nThe remaining text lists “Ashford Rhapsody” and “Jazz Storm”.\nThe arrangement calls for a full jazz ensemble, heavy drums, and maximum volume.\nOnly “PM” remains in the time field, with V.R.'s signature in the corner."
      ],
      "ShortDescribe": [
        "节目单残片保留了曲目、强鼓点、音量 5，但时间栏缺失。",
        "The fragment shows the titles, heavy drums, and volume 5, but not the time."
      ],
      "location": [
        "厨房",
        "Kitchen"
      ],
      "Chapter": "EPI01",
      "Loop": "3",
      "folderPath": "EPI01\\JamesKitchen",
      "desSpritePath": "SC9009_item_06_big",
      "iconPath": "SC9009_item_06_icon",
      "Position": [
        "-1"
      ],
      "ArtRequirement": "**重点（信息表达必不可少）**：\n1. 曲目名可辨：Ashford Rhapsody / Jazz Storm（以及其他曲目）\n2. 演奏时间一栏**完全缺失 / 被撕去**——玩家看不到任何具体时间（与 9501 完整节目单形成对比：一件有时间，一件无时间）\n3. 纸张状态：被撕成碎片 + 边缘烧焦，残存约原节目单的 40-60%\n\n**美术参考（不影响推理）**：\n- 获取方式：AVG 对话获得，不作为场景可点击物生成\n- 在 9501 同款节目单版式基础上做撕碎 + 烧焦处理（不是独立资源，与 9501 一脉相承）\n- 撕裂边缘不规则，烧焦痕炭黑色带卷曲\n- 1920s 酒吧节目单印刷风格",
      "HiddenStuff": "true"
    },
    {
      "id": "1503",
      "Name": [
        "James O'Sullivan 给 Whale 的短笺",
        "James's Note to Whale"
      ],
      "itemType": "3",
      "ActionParam": "111",
      "canAnalyzed": "false",
      "canCombined": "false",
      "Describe": [
        "James O'Sullivan 写给 Whale 的短笺。\n纸上只有几行：\n“Whale 先生，\n今晚 20:00，后门见。”\n下方签着 James O'Sullivan，签名处有一团墨渍。",
        "A short note from James O'Sullivan to Whale.\nIt reads:\n“Mr. Whale,\nTonight, 20:00, back door.”\nJames O'Sullivan signs at the bottom, partly smeared by an ink blot."
      ],
      "ShortDescribe": [
        "James O'Sullivan 给 Whale 的短笺约在今晚 20:00 后门见。",
        "James asks Whale to meet at the back door at 20:00."
      ],
      "location": [
        "James 家卧室",
        "James's Bedroom"
      ],
      "Chapter": "EPI01",
      "Loop": "5",
      "folderPath": "EPI01\\JamesHouse",
      "desSpritePath": "SC9012_item_03_big",
      "mapSpritePath": "SC9012_item_03",
      "iconPath": "SC9012_item_03_icon",
      "Position": [
        "1989",
        "786",
        "-1"
      ],
      "ArtRequirement": "**重点（信息表达必不可少）**：\n1. 抬头可读：“鲸鱼”先生,\n2. 正文内容可读：Tonight, 20:00, back door.\n3. 所有 \"J\" 字母弯钩倒写（清晰可见，与 9302、9402、9504 字迹一致）\n4. 签名可读：James\n5. 草稿 / 未完成感（涂改、划改、留白等痕迹，说明此封未寄出）\n\n**美术参考（不影响推理）**：\n- 手写回信草稿，letter size（约 22×28 cm）\n- 普通信纸（白 / 淡奶色）质感，非正式\n- 钢笔 / 墨水手写\n- 涂改 / 划字 / 停笔留白的具体呈现方式\n- 平摊状态（未装信封）",
      "HiddenStuff": "false"
    },
    {
      "id": "1505",
      "Name": [
        "Anna O'Sullivan 的移民补件通知",
        "Anna's Immigration Notice"
      ],
      "itemType": "3",
      "canAnalyzed": "false",
      "canCombined": "false",
      "Describe": [
        "美国劳工部移民局寄给 Anna O'Sullivan 的补件通知。\n\n文件日期是 1928 年 10 月 31 日，要求她在 1928 年 11 月 7 日前补交费用凭证和经济担保证明；逾期，申请将被延后审理，甚至可能失效。\n\n通知下方夹着 James O'Sullivan 的非配额配偶资格表，出生地写着爱尔兰科克，状态仍为已受理，还没有批准。\n\n这不是一份已经落定的批准书，而是一道限期补上的门槛。",
        "A U.S. Department of Labor Bureau of Immigration evidence request sent to Anna O'Sullivan.\n\nDated October 31, 1928, it requires her to submit fee receipts and proof of financial support by November 7, 1928. Missing the deadline could delay the application or cause it to lapse.\n\nAttached beneath it is James O'Sullivan's Non-Quota Spouse Eligibility Form. His birthplace is listed as Cork, Ireland, and the status remains received, not approved.\n\nThis is not a settled approval. It is a deadline that still has to be met."
      ],
      "ShortDescribe": [
        "Anna O'Sullivan 的移民申请需要限期补交费用凭证和经济担保证明；James O'Sullivan 的配偶资格仍未批准。",
        "Anna's application needs fee receipts and proof of support by the deadline; James's spouse status is still pending."
      ],
      "location": [
        "James 家卧室",
        "James's Bedroom"
      ],
      "Chapter": "EPI01",
      "Loop": "5",
      "folderPath": "EPI01\\JamesHouse",
      "desSpritePath": "SC9012_item_05_big",
      "mapSpritePath": "SC9012_item_05",
      "iconPath": "SC9012_item_05_icon",
      "Position": [
        "972",
        "737",
        "-1"
      ],
      "ArtRequirement": "【证据定位】James 杀人动机证据。玩家需要看懂：这不是移民批准通知，而是要求 Anna 限期补交材料的通知。它证明 James 并不是没那么急，而是被钱和身份文件的截止期逼住。\n\n【重点（信息表达必不可少）】\n1. 主件抬头可读：U.S. Department of Labor — Bureau of Immigration。\n2. 主件性质明确：Notice to Furnish Additional Evidence / Request for Additional Evidence，不能画成 Approval Notice。\n3. 主件申请人姓名可读：Anna O'Sullivan。\n4. 核心语句可读：Submit fee receipt and proof of financial support by November 7, 1928。\n5. 状态章建议：ACTION REQUIRED / PENDING；绝不能出现 APPROVED。\n6. 下方夹着附件：Non-Quota Spouse Eligibility Form。\n7. 附件申请人全名可读：James O'Sullivan。\n8. 附件出生地可读：Cork, Ireland。\n9. 附件状态可读：Received / Pending，不能是 Approved。\n10. 两份文件可用回形针或文件夹固定在一起，方便玩家理解 Anna 的补件通知和 James 的配偶资格未批是同一组证据。\n\n【现有资源名沿用】\n详情图：SC9012_item_05_big\n地图图：SC9012_item_05\nicon：SC9012_item_05_icon\n\n【需要重出美术资源】原图如果仍表现为 APPROVED / 批准通知，需要整体改成补件通知和未批准附件。",
      "HiddenStuff": "false"
    },
