      "itemType": "3",
      "ActionParam": "111",
      "canAnalyzed": "false",
      "canCombined": "false",
      "Describe": [
        "Harold Morrison 的借据。\n日期是 1928 年 10 月 14 日；借款人是 Harold Morrison 警探，出借人是 Whale。\n本金 6000 美元，条款写着 Harold Morrison 承诺按要求偿还六千美元。\n底部有 Harold Morrison 警探和 Whale 的签名。",
        "Harold Morrison's loan note, dated October 14, 1928.\nBorrower: Detective Harold Morrison. Lender: Whale. Principal amount: $6,000.\nThe note says Harold Morrison promises to pay Whale six thousand dollars in lawful U.S. money on demand.\nIt is signed by both Detective Harold Morrison and Whale."
      ],
      "ShortDescribe": [
        "借款记录写着 Harold Morrison 向“W 先生”借了 6000 美元。",
        "The loan record says Harold Morrison borrowed $6,000 from Mr. W."
