      "id": "1606",
      "Name": [
        "华盛顿公园赛马场马票存根",
        "Washington Park Betting Stubs"
      ],
      "itemType": "2",
      "canAnalyzed": "false",
      "canCombined": "false",
      "Describe": [
        "一叠华盛顿公园赛马场的马票存根。\n露出来的票面有 2 美元、10 美元、50 美元、500 美元，底下还能看到一张 1000 美元的大额票。\n多张都盖着醒目的“已输”，且写着同日赛事后无效、不可退款。\n\n这些不是偶尔消遣留下的票根，而是一场越输越深的习惯。",
        "A thick stack of Washington Park Racetrack betting stubs.\nVisible tickets show $2, $10, $50, $500, and even a $1,000 ticket underneath.\nMost are stamped LOST, with “not good after same day's race, no refund.”\n\nThey look less like casual betting and more like a habit sinking deeper."
      ],
      "ShortDescribe": [
